Dialogue: 1,0:00:03.00,0:00:06.00,staff,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fs60}翻译：挂件 kurako sigterm  时轴：澄空秋色  校对：小恐龙 小孝  压制：James
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.95,0:00:53.74,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Hey 調子どうだい?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.18,0:00:55.66,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}どうだって晴れだい
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.02,0:00:58.34,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}頑張っても 頑張んなくても
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.43,0:01:02.25,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Hey どんな壁だって
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.25,0:01:04.17,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}目の前にあれど
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.17,0:01:08.38,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}気づかない だって壁じゃない
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.38,0:01:16.59,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}どんな寂しさも 全部受け止めるからね
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.59,0:01:18.69,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}（Wake Up!） ちょっと遊んだり
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.69,0:01:20.94,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}（Hey World!） ちょっと悩んだり
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.94,0:01:22.98,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}ないものばっか数えないで
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.98,0:01:24.82,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}手んなかそっと数えたら
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.82,0:01:26.86,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}（Get One!） ほらね聞こえる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.86,0:01:28.99,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}（Get One!） ほらね感じる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.99,0:01:32.93,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}（Take One!） 君に伝えたくて ここにいるから
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.45,0:01:35.24,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}We can do!! で You can ドゥ!!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.24,0:01:37.62,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}世界ごと Love & peace
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.62,0:01:39.86,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}あれもこれもそれもどれも
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.86,0:01:41.80,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}半分こ （にしよう）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.80,0:01:45.96,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}あらゆる世界が私たち変えても
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.96,0:01:48.22,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}嬉しい楽しい美味しいだけは
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.22,0:01:50.72,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}忘れないでーね!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.03,0:01:53.18,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Hey world?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.06,0:01:55.18,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Say yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.10,0:01:57.23,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Good world!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.95,0:00:53.74,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Hey 心情怎么样?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.18,0:00:55.66,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}像晴天一样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.02,0:00:58.34,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}努力也好 不努力也好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.43,0:01:02.25,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Hey 无论什么墙壁
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.25,0:01:04.17,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}在我的眼前
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.17,0:01:08.38,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}也不在意它 也不会阻挡我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.38,0:01:16.59,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}无论怎样寂寞 全部欣然接受
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.59,0:01:18.69,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}（Wake Up!） 再玩一小会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.69,0:01:20.94,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}（Hey World!） 稍有些烦恼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.94,0:01:22.98,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}没有的东西不要去数了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.98,0:01:24.82,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}只要数清手中的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.82,0:01:26.86,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}（Get One!） 就能听得见
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.86,0:01:28.99,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}（Get One!） 就会感受到
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.99,0:01:32.93,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}（Take One!） 我就在这里 想要对你说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.45,0:01:35.24,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}我们能做到!! 豆能做到!!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.24,0:01:37.62,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}带给每个世界 Love & peace
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.62,0:01:39.86,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}这里 那里 这里 那里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.86,0:01:41.80,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}一半（分给你）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.80,0:01:45.96,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}就算让世界 改变了我们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.96,0:01:48.22,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}只有开心 欢乐和美味
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.22,0:01:50.72,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}请不要忘记!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.03,0:01:53.18,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Hey world?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.06,0:01:55.18,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Say yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.10,0:01:57.23,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Good world!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.77,0:22:15.90,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}娘のドゥが
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.52,0:22:17.95,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}優しすぎる~!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.18,0:22:27.22,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}はいはい!　そろそろ　危機感!?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.46,0:22:30.91,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}予測をつかない思考回路
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.19,0:22:33.47,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}はいはい!　たびたび　虚無感!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.47,0:22:36.96,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}私の手に負えない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.40,0:22:39.82,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}なんてこと…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.82,0:22:42.97,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}このところ魔界は平和です
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.36,0:22:45.79,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}だけどちょっと
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.79,0:22:47.70,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}こんなのもいいのかなぁ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.70,0:22:48.85,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}にこにこにこ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.85,0:22:50.14,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}いっせーの
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.14,0:22:52.41,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}いっこ　にこ　さんこ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.41,0:22:53.14,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}なんだい?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.14,0:22:55.41,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}分けてあげるよ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.41,0:22:56.11,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}うんうん
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.11,0:22:59.36,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}みんな一緒でにこにこ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.36,0:23:01.57,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}みんな一緒で　みんなにこにこ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.57,0:23:02.53,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}はいはい
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.53,0:23:04.63,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}みんな一緒で　みんなにこにこ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.63,0:23:05.54,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}はいはい
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.54,0:23:07.53,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}みんな一緒で　みんなにこにこ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.53,0:23:10.16,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}ちょいまちー!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.16,0:23:12.85,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}こんなんじゃダメダメダメダメだ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.85,0:23:14.71,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}流されちゃいそうだ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.71,0:23:17.71,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}忙しいの　私
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.71,0:23:20.30,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}世·界·侵·略!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.30,0:23:23.34,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}こんなはずじゃないのに
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.34,0:23:24.83,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}ダメダメダメダメだ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.83,0:23:26.65,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}流されちゃダメだ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.65,0:23:29.72,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}次から次ToDo
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.72,0:23:32.14,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}お·め·め　うるうる
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.14,0:23:35.14,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}にこにこしちゃいそう
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.77,0:23:38.41,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}にっ!　にこにこ!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.77,0:22:15.90,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}我的女儿豆豆
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.52,0:22:17.95,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}太温柔了~!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.18,0:22:27.22,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}好啦好啦! 快快 危机感!?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.46,0:22:30.91,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}无法预测的思考回路
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.19,0:22:33.47,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}好啦好啦! 偶尔 虚无感!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.47,0:22:36.96,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}我两手都忙不过来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.40,0:22:39.82,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}怎么会这样…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.82,0:22:42.97,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}最近的魔界真和平
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.36,0:22:45.79,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}不过有点觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.79,0:22:47.70,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}也许这样也不错吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.70,0:22:48.85,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}微笑微笑微笑
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.85,0:22:50.14,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}一二三
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.14,0:22:52.41,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}1个 2个 3个
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.41,0:22:53.14,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.14,0:22:55.41,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}排排坐 分果果
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.41,0:22:56.11,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.11,0:22:59.36,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}大家一起微笑微笑
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.36,0:23:01.57,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}大家一起 一起微笑微笑
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.57,0:23:02.53,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}好好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.53,0:23:04.63,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}大家一起 一起微笑微笑
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.63,0:23:05.54,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}好好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.54,0:23:07.53,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}大家一起 一起微笑微笑
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.53,0:23:10.16,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}给我等等—!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.16,0:23:12.85,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}这样可不行不行不行不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.85,0:23:14.71,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}要被带偏了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.71,0:23:17.71,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}忙活的可是我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.71,0:23:20.30,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}侵·略·世·界!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.30,0:23:23.34,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}本来不是该是这样的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.34,0:23:24.83,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}不行不行不行不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.83,0:23:26.65,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}不能被带偏了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.65,0:23:29.72,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}接连不断的ToDo
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.72,0:23:32.14,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}大·眼·睛 泪水汪汪
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.14,0:23:35.14,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}要微笑微笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.77,0:23:38.41,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}笑! 微笑微笑!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.18,0:14:35.27,IN-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}喂 喂 喂 爷爷
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.61,0:14:42.36,IN-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}喂 喂 喂 爷爷
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.74,0:14:46.24,IN-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}快看快看 天气真好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.37,0:14:49.74,IN-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}就像豆豆的心情一样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.95,0:14:53.46,IN-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}太阳公公 笑眯眯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.46,0:14:57.00,IN-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}因为和爷爷在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.13,0:15:00.51,IN-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}好想牵手呀
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.63,0:15:04.09,IN-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}可以牵手吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.22,0:15:08.60,IN-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}凉凉的 又暖暖的
